  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names him a famous Eastern Sea enslavement path Gu Immortal at the peak of rank seven when confronting Ren Xiu Ping’s newly ascended grandson in the turbulent flow sea area. Narration places the grandson as someone Ren Xiu Ping recently found and spent much effort raising to immortality.",
      "chapters": [
        1155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is an elderly Gu Immortal with a tall nose and thin eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        1458
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the grandson activates traveling son Gu, he arrives inside Ren Xiu Ping’s blessed land. Ren Xiu Ping chides him for sneaking out while the immortal aperture was stabilizing, memorizes the name Chu Ying, and resolves to deal with that person later.",
      "chapters": [
        1156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-and-grandson",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_traveling_son_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On a nameless Eastern Sea island he collects repayment from Fairy Tong Hua after she sells light shine fungi. He is one of her lenders, with the strictest agreement and highest interest, and later sells her an incomplete wood path true inheritance from Kui Wu Zi while withholding crucial parts so the inheritance will not help her modification work.",
      "chapters": [
        1458
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lending-to-tong-hua",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tong_hua"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He attempts to assassinate Miao Ming Shen with an ice poison starfish while seeking a share of the blue dragon whale and Paradise Earth true inheritance on terms Miao Ming Shen rejects. Gui Qi Ye blocks the fatal strike meant for Miao Ming Shen.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-poison-starfish-plot",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_miao_ming_shen",
        "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance",
        "char_gui_qi_ye"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen lists him among forces opposing that expedition and treats him as a crafty lone immortal with helpers of his own.",
      "chapters": [
        1650
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blue-dragon-whale-expedition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
